<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguayan cattle output up 5.0 pct in Jan/Sept.</title>
<headline>Paraguayan cattle output up 5.0 pct in Jan/Sept.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's cattle raising sector rose 5.0 percent in January-September from the same period a year ago, the Central Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>The Bank did not provide figures, just percentage changes.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla Asuncion Newsroom 595 21 444527</p>
